rmal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;MISS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt; (rare, after eviction) → query DB again, repopulate Redis.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:18pt;margin-bottom:4pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;6. Why This Layering Works&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;DB&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;: Durable, stores all mappings permanently.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;Redis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;: Protects DB by serving frequent lookups in 1ms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;CDN&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;: Protects everything by caching full HTTP redirect globally.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt; Flow speeds up over time:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;First request → slowest (DB hit).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;Second → faster (Redis).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;Third+ → fastest (CDN).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:18pt;margin-bottom:4pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;7. GET vs POST&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Roboto Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; color: rgb(24, 128, 56); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;POST /shorten&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt; → App creates new short key and saves mapping.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Roboto Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; color: rgb(24, 128, 56); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;GET /abc123&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt; → App resolves key and issues 302 redirect.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;Both work because DNS routes &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Roboto Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; color: rgb(24, 128, 56); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;short.ly&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt; to backend, and Flask routes requests based on the path.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:18pt;margin-bottom:4pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;8. Analogy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;Think of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;short.ly&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt; as a shop:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;DNS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt; = Google Maps → finds the shop.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;Counter 1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt; = “create new link” (POST).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;Counter 2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt; = “get original link” (GET).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;Redis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt; = files on your desk (fast).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;DB&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt; = records in the archive room (durable).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;CDN&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt; = photocopies distributed in libraries worldwide (fastest).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;In summary:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;Create URL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt; → App writes to DB (and Redis).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;First click&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt; → CDN miss → Redis miss → DB fetch → Redis update → CDN caches 302.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;Later clicks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt; → Served by CDN instantly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" s