          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2wz8P_fBrSEnt0lHdRcw-42" value="&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-b2576010-7fff-5d84-171e-66f8be297125&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;When the client clicks &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Roboto Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; color: rgb(24, 128, 56); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;short.ly/abc123&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt; and CDN serves the redirect (HIT), how do we still capture the click for counters/analytics if backend is never hit?”&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;This is a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;real-world pain point&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt; in URL shortener design. Let’s go through the flows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;Flow 1: CDN MISS (normal backend path)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;When CDN doesn’t have the redirect cached:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Roboto Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; color: rgb(24, 128, 56); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;User → CDN MISS → Backend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Roboto Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; color: rgb(24, 128, 56); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;Backend → Redis/DB → Return 302&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Roboto Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; color: rgb(24, 128, 56); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;Backend → Push event → Queue&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Roboto Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; color: rgb(24, 128, 56); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;Consumer → Update DB + Analytics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;Here it’s easy: backend sees the click, logs the event, updates counters.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Flow 2: CDN HIT (no backend call)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;When CDN has the 302 cached:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Roboto Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; color: rgb(24, 128, 56); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;User → CDN HIT → Redirect to long URL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Roboto Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; color: rgb(24, 128, 56); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;(no backend, no Redis, no DB, no event queue)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;Problem: Backend never sees this request → &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;no analytics, no counters.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;How to Fix Analytics in CDN HIT Case&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:14pt;margin-bottom:4pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;Option A – Short TTL on CDN&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;Don’t let CDN cache the 302 forever.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;Use &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Roboto Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; color: rgb(24, 128, 56); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;Cache-Control: max-age=60&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt; → CDN expires entry every 1 minute.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;Ensures backend still gets periodic hits (at cost of more load).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;Option B – Log at CDN Edge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;Modern CDNs (Cloudflare, Akamai, Fastly) let you run &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;edge functions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;Cloudflare Workers, Akamai EdgeWorkers, Fastly Compute@Edge.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;They can log request metadata (IP, UA, short key) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;before serving cached 302&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;Logs are pushed to Kafka/BigQuery directly from the CDN.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;Example:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt; User clicks → Cloudflare Worker → logs event (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Roboto Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; color: rgb(24, 128, 56); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;abc123&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;, IP, UA) → returns cached 302.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-640" y="1540" width="570" height="1320" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
